WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:03.100
- [Narrator] Now the dust has
settled on Stranger Things 3

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.180
we thought you might
need a little something

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.780
to channel your obsession
with the iconic cast.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.430
Here's a list of things you might not know

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.700
about the actors who play
your favorite characters

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.013
from the show.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.763
(80's pop music)

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:20.830
Let's start with Eleven
herself, Millie Bobby Brown.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.390
Before her breakout roll
Millie guest starred

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.920
in Grey's Anatomy, Modern Family,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.510
and Once Upon a Time in Wonderland.

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:30.170
- I promise to bring it back, all right!

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.447
- No, that's what you said
about my mom's humidifier!

00:00:32.447 --> 00:00:35.450
- [Narrator] Millie is
partially deaf in one ear

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:38.270
and when she's performing
she can't fully hear herself.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:40.840
She often couldn't hear when
the director yelled "action"

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.495
on set unless it was really loud.

00:00:43.495 --> 00:00:44.799
(screaming)

00:00:44.799 --> 00:00:47.632
(window breaking)

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.730
Her first ever kiss was on
the set of Stranger Things

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:55.680
with on-screen boyfriend Finn Wolfhard.

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:01.220
Speaking of Finn, did you know

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:03.840
that he first auditioned
for Mike while sick in bed?

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.965
Where do we get that kind of discipline?

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.573
- Boom, boom, boom!

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:12.780
- [Narrator] It might come
from his film-centric family.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:16.400
His older brother is an actor
and his dad is a screenwriter.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.680
When he's not acting

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:21.015
Finn plays with his rock band, Calpurnia.

00:01:21.015 --> 00:01:25.560
♪ And nobody wants to know you now ♪

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.320
- [Narrator] He's not the only
musician in the cast though.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.850
Gaten Matarazzo used to be in his own band

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:32.153
called Work in Progress.

00:01:32.153 --> 00:01:36.486
♪ Turn around, look at what you see ♪

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.600
- [Narrator] Gaten was the
first of the party to be cast

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:43.710
landing the role of Dustin even though

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:46.700
he originally auditioned for Mike.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:50.230
He was born with a condition
called cleidocranial dysplasia

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:52.810
which affects bone and teeth development.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:56.470
The Duffer brothers adapted
the role especially for him.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:57.940
- Trust me, no collar bones, remember?

00:01:57.940 --> 00:01:59.233
- Uh, excuse me?

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:03.735
- Oh he's got some disease.

00:02:03.735 --> 00:02:07.620
It's crydo...something, yeah I don't know.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:08.453
He's missing bones and stuff.

00:02:08.453 --> 00:02:09.550
He can bend like Gumbo.

00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:11.780
- [Narrator] Before he
starred in Stranger Things

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:14.900
he was a sweet Broadway
babe with roles in Les Mis

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.050
and Priscilla Queen of the Desert.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:20.010
He's not the only Broadway
star in Hawkins though.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:20.931
Caleb McLaughlin played young Simba

00:02:20.931 --> 00:02:24.460
in the Lion King for two whole years.

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.810
He also studied dance at the
Harlem School of the Arts

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:30.585
with one of the Lion King's
original cast members.

00:02:30.585 --> 00:02:33.835
♪ Look at what you see ♪

00:02:35.163 --> 00:02:36.560
- [Narrator] Caleb
revealed in an interview

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:38.840
that he's a real germaphobe.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.270
Not ideal for venturing
into the Upside Down.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.200
On the subject of the Upside Down

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:47.090
let's talk about someone who
knows a few things about it.

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:49.640
Noah Schnapp, who plays Will Byers.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:52.970
Born in 2004 he's the
youngest member of the party

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:54.450
with only eight month's difference

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:56.200
between him and Millie Bobby Brown.

00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:00.090
He's been acting since
he was just six years old

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:02.691
having starred in Bridge
of Spies, the Peanuts Movie

00:03:02.691 --> 00:03:04.710
and the Angry Birds Movie.

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:07.170
- Sometimes I wonder if
the kids really like me.

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:08.560
- [Narrator] He may be
one of the younger members

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:11.340
of the cast but he is older than someone.

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:16.110
His twin sister Chloe, by four
minutes but it still counts.

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:18.530
He doesn't technically
have an on-screen sister

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.298
but he does kind of have
an on-screen sister in law

00:03:21.298 --> 00:03:24.434
in Natalia Dyer who plays Nancy Wheeler.

00:03:24.434 --> 00:03:26.461
Did you know that her first acting role

00:03:26.461 --> 00:03:30.573
was playing a fan in the
Hannah Montana Movie?

00:03:30.573 --> 00:03:32.906
(screaming)

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.870
The Best of Both Worlds
written about the Upside Down?

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.210
Confirmed.

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:42.070
Both on and off screen

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:44.843
Natalia is dating co-star Charlie Heaton.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:53.380
Charlie, like most of
the rest of his co-stars,

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:56.020
is a musician and plays the drums.

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:58.020
He's also the only one in the main cast

00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:59.663
to have his own baby IRL.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:01.630
Cute!

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.460
Someone else who knows a bit
about having a famous parent

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:07.700
is Maya Hawke, AKA Robin,
who is the daughter

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:11.420
of Hollywood legends Uma
Thurman and Ethan Hawke.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:15.660
Before joining the cast she
stared in the 2017 adaptation

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:17.960
of Little Women playing the same character

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:21.930
as co-star Winona Ryder
in the 1994 version.

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:24.950
Maya has already modeled
for Vogue and Calvin Klein

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:27.940
and this is all before her breakout role.

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:30.590
Another cast member who's
no stranger to modeling

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:33.310
is Mad Max herself, Sadie Sink.

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:37.420
She strutted down the catwalk
at Paris Fashion Week in 2018.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:41.260
At just 17 she has already
played Annie on Broadway,

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:43.850
a young Queen Elizabeth on stage,

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.510
and guest starred on the
Unbreakable Kimmy Schmidt.

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:47.900
- Elena, you try, his head is perfect.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:51.370
- Wait, wait, wait, look
I know you're acting out

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.410
but it's probably just problems at home.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:54.660
- What did you say about our homes?

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.330
- Oh I didn't know!

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.640
- [Narrator] Meanwhile, Joe
Keery played Ferris Bueller

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:02.134
in a Domino's commercial back in 2017.

00:05:02.134 --> 00:05:04.884
(80's pop music)

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:08.770
- Get that pizza.

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:10.483
- [Narrator] We love it.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:15.500
He's another one that plays
in a band called Post Animal.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.860
So when's Stranger Things,
the musical dropping?

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:22.060
Dacre Montgomery who plays
Billy would absolutely be down.

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:23.810
The Australian has his own podcast

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:25.960
where he performs beat poetry over music

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.740
from different artists.

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:29.460
- [Dacre] My body is so spent

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.100
dripping sweat, kitchen
sink, blood on my teeth

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.770
aching minds, splitting
skulls, sleepless nights.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.200
- [Narrator] So there you have it.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.700
Just a few facts about the actors

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:43.130
who play your favorite
characters on the show.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:45.620
Oh, and one more bonus fact.

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.460
The cast have a group chat
called Stranger Texts.

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:51.210
Um, how do we get an invite?

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:53.440
Know any more facts about the cast?

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:55.140
Leave them in the comment's below.

